   </table:table>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2689_848753940"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="les-scripts-msl"/>Les scripts mSL<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2689_848753940"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="les-scripts-msl"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Interstys contient l’interpréteur <text:span text:style-name="T2">mSL</text:span> (<text:span text:style-name="T1">micro Script Language</text:span>) de CMGS. Un fichier <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.mSL</text:span> déposé n’importe où dans la fenêtre est compilé et exécuté. Ses <text:span text:style-name="T12">commandes</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">print</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T12">(...)</text:span></text:span> écrivent dans le journal.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2691_848753940"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="les-paramètres"/>Les paramètres<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2691_848753940"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="les-paramètres"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Un script lit un paramètre par son nom court : <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">gui(`slider, `LineSize)</text:span> rend son descripteur ([1] numéro, [3] valeur, [4] nom, [5] format), ou <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">$undef</text:span> si le nom est inconnu. Les noms courts sont ceux de la déclaration des paramètres : <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">PlaySpd</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">PlayVol</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">LineSize</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">CrssFade</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">WrOvrdb</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">LfoFreq</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">FltFreq</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">FltQ</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">SatDrive</text:span>…</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">Chaque plug-in de CMGS a sa plage de numéros de paramètres, parmi 1024 : celle d’Interstys va de 256 à 511. <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">get(`pval, n)</text:span> lit n’importe quel numéro de 0 à 1023 (ceux des autres plug-ins, tels qu’ils les publient) ; <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">set(`pval, n, v)</text:span> ne <text:span text:style-name="T12">permet de </text:span>change<text:span text:style-name="T12">r</text:span> que ceux d’Interstys (sinon l’erreur 0621 <text:span text:style-name="T12">est signalée</text:span>, écrite une <text:span text:style-name="T14">seule </text:span>fois).</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2693_848753940"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="la-table-décrire-un-patch"/>La table : décrire un patch<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2693_848753940"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="la-table-décrire-un-patch"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">L’opération mSL <text:span text:style-name="T2">table</text:span> décrit des modules dans une liste de mots, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">data(...)</text:span> :</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">var r = table(data(</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>Interstys</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>Line l <text:s/>length 2 <text:s/>chan 2</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>Writer w <text:s/>line l <text:s/>source In:0 <text:s/>overdub 40 <text:s/>status Writing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>Reader r <text:s/>writer w <text:s/>delay 0.375 <text:s/>out Out:0 <text:s/>status Reading</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">));</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Le résultat est 0, ou le code de la première erreur. La table est une suite de <text:span text:style-name="T2">blocs</text:span> ; un bloc commence par son mot de tête <text:span text:style-name="T13">(« Line », « Writer », etc.) </text:span>et finit au bloc suivant. Le premier mot <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Interstys</text:span> est facultatif.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">Dans un bloc :</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L19">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P25">les <text:span text:style-name="T2">clés</text:span> vont par paires « clé valeur », dans n’importe quel ordre ; une clé omise garde la valeur du module, ou sa valeur par défaut s’il est créé ;</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P25">les <text:span text:style-name="T2">unités</text:span> sont celles de l’interface : s, dB, Hz, %, octaves ;</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P25">un module est désigné par un <text:span text:style-name="T2">numéro</text:span> (1 à 256) ou par un <text:span text:style-name="T2">nom</text:span> (un identificateur qui n’est pas un mot réservé). Un nom n’est valable que dans la table : il reçoit un module libre, qu’aucun numéro de la table ne désigne. Le journal indique « Interstys table : w = Writer 3 » ;</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P25">les sources s’écrivent <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">In:c</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Out:c</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Bus n[:c]</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Ctl n</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Reader id[:c]</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Effect id[:c]</text:span>, ou <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">none</text:span> ; les sorties <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Own</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Out:c</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Bus n[:c]</text:span>.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">La table est analysée en <text:span text:style-name="T2">quatre passes</text:span>, et <text:span text:style-name="T2">rien n’est modifié avant la dernière</text:span> : une erreur n’importe où dans la table empêche tout changement. Les passes sont : les numéros, les noms, une simulation <text:span text:style-name="T15">de la configuration finale </text:span>(lignes, canaux, retards…), puis l’exécution.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="line"/>Line<text:bookmark-end text:name="line"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">Line id <text:s/>[length s] <text:s/>[chan n] <text:s/>[spls n] <text:s/>[file &quot;nom.wav&quot;]</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Crée la ligne, la garde si elle est identique à <text:span text:style-name="T15">la ligne existante de même numéro</text:span>, la remplace sinon (ses writers et readers suivent). <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">file</text:span> lit un fichier son dans la ligne : sa durée et ses canaux viennent du fichier (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">length</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">chan</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">spls</text:span> sont alors ignorés). Un nom relatif est cherché dans le dossier du projet, donné par GMAuxiliary.eel (le journal indique « Project <text:soft-page-break/>folder : … »).</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="writer"/>Writer<text:bookmark-end text:name="writer"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">Writer id <text:s/>line L <text:s/>source S <text:s/>gain dB <text:s/>overdub %</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="11"/>mode XFade|Sum|WMix <text:s/>first n <text:s/>used n</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="11"/>direction Forward|Backward|Both</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="11"/>fade s <text:s/>plateau s <text:s/>wait s <text:s/>direction d <text:s/>desync %</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="11"/>mod E S [options] <text:s/>status Ready|Paused|Writing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">fade</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">plateau</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">wait</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">direction</text:span> suivi d’un nombre et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">desync</text:span> sont les réglages <text:span text:style-name="T15">propres au</text:span> mode W-Mix (voir « Le mode W-Mix »). En modes XFade et Sum, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">direction Forward|Backward|Both</text:span> donne le sens d’écriture (voir « Le sens d’écriture ») ; le Dump ne l’écrit que s’il n’est pas <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Forward</text:span>. <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod</text:span> branche les entrées de modulation <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Gain</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Overdub</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Fade</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Plateau</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Wait</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Dir</text:span> et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Desync</text:span>, avec les options des effets (voir Effect).</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="reader"/>Reader<text:bookmark-end text:name="reader"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">Reader id <text:s/>line L | writer W <text:s/>mode M <text:s/>delay s <text:s/>speed x</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="11"/>out D <text:s/>vol dB <text:s/>first n <text:s/>used n <text:s/>outchan n</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="11"/>loop once|repeat|catch|loop|exit|stop</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="11"/>loopspeed x <text:s/>desync s <text:s/>cross On|Off <text:s/>follow W|none</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="11"/>mod E S [options] <text:s/>status Ready|Paused|Reading</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">Stretch, Brage : <text:s/>block ms <text:s/>overlap % <text:s/>search ms <text:s/>transp st</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">Stretch : <text:s/>stretch x</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">Grains : <text:s/>size ms <text:s/>sizernd r <text:s/>plateau % <text:s/>platrnd r</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="10"/>fadein % <text:s/>fadernd r <text:s/>curve id|none <text:s/>gvol dB</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="10"/>volrnd r <text:s/>speedrnd r <text:s/>direction d <text:s/>density n</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="10"/>onsetrnd u</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">line</text:span> met le reader dans un mode sur une ligne (Reader par défaut), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">writer</text:span> en mode délai. <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mode Read|Delay|Stretch|Brage|Grains</text:span> choisit le mode (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Reader</text:span> est accepté pour <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Read</text:span>) ; il est appliqué après <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">line</text:span> et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">writer</text:span>, et garde, comme le pad, la ligne, la boucle, la vitesse et la position d’un mode sur une ligne à l’autre. <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mode Delay</text:span> avec <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">line</text:span>, ou un mode sur une ligne avec <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">writer</text:span>, est une erreur (2774). L’état est appliqué en dernier. <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">outchan</text:span> donne le nombre de canaux de sortie (0 : le nombre de canaux lus) ; <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">cross On</text:span> fait traverser la fin de la ligne à la boucle libre ; <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">follow W</text:span> fait suivre le writer W par la boucle (un writer de la même ligne, qui écrit en avant, pas en W-Mix ; sinon la boucle reste libre, comme dans le pad), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">follow none</text:span> la libère.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Les réglages des modes ont les bornes du pad : <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">block</text:span> de 10 à 5000 ms, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">overlap</text:span> de 5 à 50 %, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">search</text:span> de 0 à 200 ms, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">transp</text:span> de −24 à 24 demi-tons, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">stretch</text:span> le tempo du mode Stretch ; en Grains, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">size</text:span> de 10 à 10 000 ms, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">plateau</text:span> et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">fadein</text:span> en %, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">curve</text:span> l’enveloppe (une courbe, son numéro ou son nom ; <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">none</text:span> : des rampes linéaires), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">gvol</text:span> le volume des grains (−20 à 20 dB), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">direction</text:span> de −1 à 1, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">density</text:span> de 0,01 à 100 grains par seconde, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">onsetrnd</text:span> de 0 (périodiques) à 1 (aléatoires) ; les clés en <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">rnd</text:span> sont les aléas, de 1 à 5. Une clé d’un autre mode est gardée, sans effet tant que le reader n’est pas dans ce mode, comme dans le pad.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod</text:span> branche les entrées <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Offset</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Speed</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Volume</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">LoopSpd</text:span> et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Desync</text:span>, avec les options des effets ; l’Offset accepte aussi <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">doppler On|Off</text:span> (modes Delay et Reader, voir « Les entrées de modulation »). Le Dump écrit le mode (sauf Reader et Delay, donnés par <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">line</text:span> et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">writer</text:span>) et ses réglages, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">follow</text:span> s’il est donné, et les entrées branchées qui ont un sens <text:soft-page-break/>dans le mode.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="effect"/>Effect<text:bookmark-end text:name="effect"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">Effect id <text:s/>type T <text:s/>status On|Off|Bypass <text:s/>phase Std|Pre|Post <text:s/>chan n <text:s/>out D <text:s/>limiter On|Off</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">suivi des clés du type :</text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Table18" table:style-name="Table18">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table18.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table18.B"/>
    <table:table-header-rows>
     <table:table-row>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Type</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Clés</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
     </table:table-row>
    </table:table-header-rows>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">None</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">—</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Mixer</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">src1 S gain1 dB</text:span> … <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">src8 S gain8 dB</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">AutoMix</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">src1 S</text:span> … <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">src8 S</text:span> (gains calculés)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">LFO</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">freq Hz</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mode</text:span> (Sine, Triangle, SawUp, SawDown, Square, Curve), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">amp a</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">offset o</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">spread s</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">curve id</text:span> (la forme Curve : une courbe, son numéro ou son nom ; pas de limiteur)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Filter</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">source S</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">gain dB</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">freq Hz</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">q x</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mode</text:span> (LP1, HP1, LP, HP, BP, Notch), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">stages</text:span> (1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Cutoff S [depth d] [att a] [law L] [shape F] [polarity P] [bypass B]</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Reso S ...</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Saturation</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">source S</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">gain dB</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mode</text:span> (Soft, Hard, Fold, SineFold, XSin, Cheb, ChebSum, Curve), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">drive dB</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">bias b</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mix %</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">os</text:span> (1, 2, 4, 8), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">output dB</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">order n</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">stretch s</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">amount A</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">harm w1 ... w16</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">curve id</text:span> (le mode Curve), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">adaa On|Off</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Drive S ...</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Bias S ...</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Order S ...</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">source S</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">gain dB</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mode</text:span> (Householder, Hadamard, Ring), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mix %</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">decay s</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">damp Hz</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">hp Hz</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">dmin ms</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">dmax ms</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">delays</text:span> (Geometric, Linear, Harmonic, Equal, Random), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">diffusion d</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">loop</text:span> (Decay, Freeze, Grow), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">seed n</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">inject</text:span> (Direct, Spread), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">wow ms</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">rate Hz</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">spread</text:span> (tours), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">glide s</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Decay S ...</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Damping S ...</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Diffusion S ...</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Flanger, Chorus</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table18.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">source S</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">gain dB</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mode</text:span> (Classic, Through, BarberUp, BarberDown), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">delay ms</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">sweep ms</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">rate Hz</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">wave</text:span> (Sine, Triangle, SawUp, SawDown, Square, Curve, Random, Hold), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">curve id</text:span> (la forme Curve), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">feedback f</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mix %</text:span> (−100 à 100), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">spread</text:span> (tours), <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">voices n</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">jitter j</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">seed n</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">cross c</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">damp Hz</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">hp Hz</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">glide s</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Delay S ...</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Rate S ...</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod Feedback S ...</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:list text:style-name="L20">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P26"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">source</text:span> et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">gain</text:span> sont <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">src1</text:span> et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">gain1</text:span>.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P26"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">harm</text:span> prend de 1 à 16 poids (les nombres jusqu’au mot suivant) ; les poids non donnés valent 0.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P26"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod X none</text:span> débranche une entrée.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P26">Un nouveau type donne d’abord ses valeurs par défaut, comme dans le pad.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P26">Un même mot peut être une clé de plusieurs types, avec son sens et sa plage : <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">spread</text:span> est le déphasage entre les canaux d’un LFO, et celui du wow d’une ligne à la suivante dans une Matrix. De même, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mix</text:span> va de 0 à 100 % dans une Saturation et une Matrix, de −100 à 100 % dans un Flanger et un Chorus. La table prend la clé du type de l’effet : celui que donne la clé <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">type</text:span> du bloc, sinon celui de l’effet existant.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P26">La forme du balayage d’un Flanger s’écrit <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">wave</text:span>, et non <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">shape</text:span> : <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">shape</text:span> est une option de <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mod</text:span> (écrit après une entrée de modulation, il serait pris par elle).</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="global"/><text:soft-page-break/>Global<text:bookmark-end text:name="global"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">Global <text:s/>samples Merge|Ignore|Pass <text:s/>input dB <text:s/>output dB</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="8"/>action StartAll|StopAll|PauseAll|ResumeAll|RewindAll|MuteAll|UnmuteAll|ClearAll <text:s/>chan n</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">L’action est exécutée en dernier, tout de suite. <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">chan</text:span> (les canaux de la piste) ne peut pas être changé : la clé est acceptée pour qu’un Dump puisse être relu, et vérifiée par Check.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="curve"/>Curve<text:bookmark-end text:name="curve"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P27">Curve id <text:s/>type Env|Wave|HEnv|QWave|HWave <text:s/>periodic Off|On <text:s/><text:tab/><text:tab/><text:tab/>name N <text:s/>sustain n|Off</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P27"><text:s text:c="10"/>points x y c <text:s/>x y c ...</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Décrit une courbe du module Curves : de 2 à 128 points, chacun donné par x (de 0 à 1, sans décroître), y (de 0 à 1 pour une enveloppe, de −1 à 1 pour une forme d’onde) et c, la courbure du segment qui part de lui (de −1 à 1). </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">id</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16"> est un numéro (1 à 64) ou un nom : un mot qui n’est pas réservé, ou un texte entre guillemets (1 à 31 caractères), et les majuscules comptent (</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Curve &quot;Attaque lente&quot; ...</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16">). Contrairement aux modules, une courbe garde son nom après la table : un nouveau nom reçoit une courbe libre. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">sustain</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16"> donne le point de sustain d’une enveloppe (son numéro, à partir de 1 ; Off : aucun). Une nouvelle courbe est une enveloppe droite, de (0, 0) à (1, 1).</text:span></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="dump-check-free-clear"/>Dump, Check, Free, Clear<text:bookmark-end text:name="dump-check-free-clear"/></text:h>
   <table:table table:name="Table19" table:style-name="Table19">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table19.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table19.B"/>
    <table:table-header-rows>
     <table:table-row>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="P28">Bloc</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Rôle</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
     </table:table-row>
    </table:table-header-rows>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Dump Line id</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16"> (ou Writer, Reader, Effect, Curve)</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">écrit le module dans le journal, <text:span text:style-name="T2">dans la syntaxe de la table</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Dump Global</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Dump All</text:span></text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">les réglages généraux ; tous les modules</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Dump Order</text:span></text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">l’ordre d’exécution des effets, et le nombre de boucles</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Check Line id clé valeur ...</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16"> (ou Writer, Reader, Effect, Curve)</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">« Check … OK », ou une erreur 2759 par différence</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Check Global clé valeur ...</text:span></text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">la même chose pour les réglages généraux</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Free Line id</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16"> (ou Writer, Reader, Effect, Curve)</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">supprime le module</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Clear</text:span></text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table19.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">supprime toutes les lignes, readers, writers, effets et instances</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Un Dump peut être relu tel quel : c’est aussi une façon d’exporter un patch.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2695_848753940"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="les-algorithmes"/>Les algorithmes<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2695_848753940"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="les-algorithmes"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Un <text:span text:style-name="T2">algorithme</text:span> est un modèle de sous-patch. Il se déclare dans une table et s’utilise autant de fois que voulu ; chaque utilisation, une <text:span text:style-name="T2">instance</text:span>, a ses propres modules.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">table(data(</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="2"/>Algorithm Echo</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>input <text:s/>src</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>output dst</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>param <text:s/>time 0.25 0.001 5</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>param <text:s/>fb 0 -150 150</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:soft-page-break/><text:s text:c="4"/>Line l <text:s/>length 5 <text:s/>chan 1</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>Writer w <text:s/>line l <text:s/>source src <text:s/>overdub fb <text:s/>status Writing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>Reader r <text:s/>writer w <text:s/>delay time <text:s/>out dst <text:s/>status Reading</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="2"/>End</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="2"/>Instance e1 Echo <text:s/>src In:0 <text:s/>dst Out:0 <text:s/>time 0.5 <text:s/>fb -3</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"><text:s text:c="2"/>Instance e2 Echo <text:s/>src Reader 3 <text:s/>dst Bus 2</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">))</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L21">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P29"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Les déclarations</text:span> viennent en tête du modèle : <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">input nom</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">output nom</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">param nom défaut min max</text:span>. Un nom déclaré ne peut pas être un mot réservé ni une clé (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">delay</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">vol</text:span>…).</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P29"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Une instance</text:span> remplace chaque paramètre par sa valeur (ou son défaut), partout où un nombre est attendu, et chaque entrée ou sortie par les mots donnés, lus dans la table : <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">src Reader rd</text:span> désigne le reader <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">rd</text:span> de la table. Les noms du modèle (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">l</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">w</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">r</text:span>) reçoivent des modules propres à l’instance.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P29"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Chaque module</text:span> nommé dans le modèle appartient à l’instance : son pad l’indique.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <table:table table:name="Table20" table:style-name="Table20">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table20.A" table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    <table:table-header-rows>
     <table:table-row>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Bloc</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Rôle</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
     </table:table-row>
    </table:table-header-rows>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Instance i Modèle arg valeur ...</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">crée une instance (les entrées et sorties sont obligatoires)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Set i arg valeur ...</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">change des arguments de l’instance</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Dump Instance i</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">l’appel, puis les modules de l’instance</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Free Instance i</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">supprime l’instance et ses modules</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Free Algorithm Modèle</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table20.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">oublie le modèle (les instances gardent leur copie)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Set</text:span> ne réapplique que les clés dont la valeur dépend d’un argument changé : les autres réglages des modules de l’instance (faits dans les pads, par une pause générale…) sont conservés.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">Les modèles et les instances sont sauvés avec le projet. Le module <text:span text:style-name="T2">Instances</text:span> les montre.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2697_848753940"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="un-exemple"/>Un exemple<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2697_848753940"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="un-exemple"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Le script <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Scripts/Interstys-Chain.mSL</text:span> construit une chaîne à écouter (le module Globals doit être en Merge) :</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P30">LFO 246 (0,2 Hz) --mod Cutoff--&gt; Filter 245 (passe-bande 800 Hz) &lt;-- In:0-1</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P30">Filter 245 --&gt; Saturation 244 --&gt; Writer 250 / Reader 250 (écho 0,375 s) --&gt; Bus 6</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P30">Mixer 243 : In (-6 dB) + Saturation 244 (-3 dB) + Bus 6 (-6 dB) --&gt; Out:0-1</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Ses numéros sont fixes : le relancer remplace les mêmes modules. Les effets sont numérotés à l’envers de la chaîne ; <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Dump Order</text:span> montre qu’ils s’exécutent pourtant dans l’ordre des câbles.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">Les scripts <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Scripts/Ex-1001.mSL</text:span> à <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Ex-1040.mSL</text:span> sont les tests d’Interstys : chacun est aussi un exemple d’emploi de la table.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc9013_848753940"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="la-bibliotheque-dalgorithmes"/>La bibliothèque d’algorithmes<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc9013_848753940"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="la-bibliotheque-dalgorithmes"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Le dossier <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Scripts/Algorithms</text:span> contient des recettes prêtes à l’emploi, pensées pour la création sonore : chaque fichier se dépose dans Interstys et installe aussitôt un algorithme (un modèle et son instance, voir « Les algorithmes ») branché sur la piste : le son de la piste (In:0) entre, le son sec et le son traité sortent vers Out:0.</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L18">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P24"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T2">Régler</text:span> : les paramètres sont sur la ligne <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Instance</text:span>, en bas de chaque fichier (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">nch</text:span>, le nombre de canaux, les durées, les fréquences, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">dry</text:span> et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">wet</text:span>) ; modifier la ligne, puis redéposer le fichier : l’instance est refaite. Les autres réglages se changent dans les pads de ses effets (pre, fdn ou fl, post), que le module Instances montre.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P24"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Essayer sans matériau</text:span> : <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Sources.mSL</text:span> met des clics (ou un buzz) sur le bus 64, que toutes les recettes écoutent aussi ; <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Sources-Stop.mSL</text:span> l’arrête ; <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Free-All.mSL</text:span> retire toutes les instances.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P24">La première fois qu’on dépose un fichier, le journal note une erreur 2787 : l’instance précédente, que le fichier retire d’abord, n’existe pas encore. C’est sans conséquence.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <table:table table:name="Table22b" table:style-name="Table22b">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table22b.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table22b.B"/>
    <table:table-header-rows>
     <table:table-row>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Fichier</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Ce qu’il fait</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
     </table:table-row>
    </table:table-header-rows>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Espace</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">un espace dense : toutes les lignes mélangées à chaque passage (Hadamard)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Traines</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">des traînes locales : chaque canal garde la sienne, qui déborde lentement (Householder)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Metal</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">un métal accordé : toutes les lignes au même retard, un seul peigne résonant</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Accord</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">un accord métallique : des retards multiples d’une période</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Masse</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une masse qui enfle : la boucle croît (Grow) et sature</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Pompe</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">un pompage collectif : un couplage négatif entre les lignes</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Souffle</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une traîne qui respire : sa durée balayée par un LFO très lent</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Tenue</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une pédale de tenue : la durée de la traîne sur un curseur Ctl (automatisable, MIDI)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Repandu</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une source mono sur tous les canaux : le canal 0 dans toutes les lignes</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Anneau</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">un anneau : chaque écho passe au haut-parleur voisin, le son tourne (Ring)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Ondule</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une traîne qui ondule : les retards modulés lentement, déphasés d’une ligne à l’autre</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Matrix-Vrille</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une vrille métallique : des retards courts modulés à vitesse audio</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Flanger-Jet</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">un jet : le mode Through-zero, le balayage traverse le son direct et l’annule au passage</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Flanger-Plaque</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une plaque de métal qui glisse : des retards très courts, une réinjection près de 1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Flanger-Hurle</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une boucle qui hurle : la réinjection dépasse 1, la boucle sature et chante seule, sa hauteur saute au hasard</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Flanger-Spirale</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une spirale sans fin : le barber pole, un balayage qui monte toujours (et tourne entre les haut-parleurs)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Flanger-Escalier</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">un escalier de hauteurs : le barber pole à retards longs transpose, chaque écho monte</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Flanger-Cloche</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une cloche : le retard modulé à vitesse audio, une modulation de phase inharmonique</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Chorus-Essaim</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">un essaim : seize voix par canal, chacune à sa vitesse et son retard</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Chorus-Ivre</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22b.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">une bande ivre : de grands retards qui dérivent, la hauteur tangue</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Les recettes du Flanger et du Chorus ont aussi trois effets : pre, fl (le Flanger ou le Chorus) et post. Dans <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Flanger-Jet</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Flanger-Plaque</text:span> et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Flanger-Spirale</text:span>, le son direct <text:soft-page-break/>passe dans l’effet : son mélange (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">blend</text:span>, de −100 à 100 %) règle le flanger, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">level</text:span> le niveau de sortie. <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Flanger-Hurle</text:span> ne s’arrête plus une fois excité (la boucle s’entretient) : <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">regen</text:span> sous 1, ou <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Free-All.mSL</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2699_848753940"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="les-codes-derreur"/>Les codes d’erreur<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2699_848753940"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="les-codes-derreur"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Les erreurs sont écrites dans le journal sous la forme « ERR: NNNN » suivie d’un message.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2701_848753940"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="les-modules"/>Les modules<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2701_848753940"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="les-modules"/></text:h>
   <table:table table:name="Table21" table:style-name="Table21">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table21.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table21.B"/>
    <table:table-header-rows>
     <table:table-row>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Code</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Sens</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
     </table:table-row>
    </table:table-header-rows>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2601</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">reader : numéro incorrect (choix du writer suivi)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2602</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">writer : numéro incorrect (pour un reader en mode délai)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2603</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">reader absent, ou pas en mode délai</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2604</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">writer absent, ou sans ligne</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2605</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">reader : numéro incorrect (changement de mode)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2606</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">reader absent, ou mode inconnu</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2607</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">numéro de ligne incorrect</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2608</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">l’entrée de la ligne n’est pas une ligne valide</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2609</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">action inconnue sur une ligne</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2610</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">pas assez de mémoire pour la ligne</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2701</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">effet : nombre de canaux incorrect</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2702</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">effet : sortie incorrecte</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2703</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">effet : source incorrecte</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2704</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">effet : une source chevauche la sortie</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2705</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">effet : aucune source</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2706</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">effet : type non exécuté (Mover, Action, Script)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2711</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">reader : sortie incorrecte</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2712</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">writer : source incorrecte</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2713</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">reader : une entrée de modulation n’est pas valide (le reader tourne sans elle)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2714</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">writer : une entrée de modulation n’est pas valide (le writer tourne sans elle)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2715</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">effet : une entrée de modulation n’est pas valide (l’effet tourne sans elle)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2716</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">les paramètres d’Interstys dépassent sa plage de numéros (au démarrage)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2717</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">les clés des effets dépassent la taille des tableaux d’un bloc de la table (au démarrage)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2718</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">trop de mots réservés pour la table (au démarrage)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2771</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">fichier son : impossible de l’ouvrir</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2772</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">fichier son : pas utilisable pour une ligne (canaux, fréquence, durée)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2773</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">fichier son : erreur de lecture</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2791</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table21.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">des modules supprimés n’ont pas pu être libérés (corbeille pleine)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
